    <string name="about_title">About FocusGuard</string>
    <string name="about_body">FocusGuard detects visual patterns unique to the Shorts, Reels and TikTok feed player using Android\'s accessibility service, and closes that content instantly. It does not read, store or transmit app content: it only compares on-screen identifiers against an internal pattern list.\n\nBecause YouTube, Instagram and TikTok change their layout with every update, blocking may occasionally miss until FocusGuard is updated.\n\nFocusGuard never requests the Internet permission: all information stays on this device only.</string>
